  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has actively championed the need for enhanced regional cooperation and strategic alliances to drive economic growth and stability. During recent international forums, including the APEC 2026 summit, the President urged nations to adopt policies centered on innovation and collaborative progress. This push for broader engagement is reflected in multiple ongoing initiatives, ranging from discussions on regional electricity integration to nuclear energy development projects with international counterparts. Officials, including Bahlil Lahadalia, have stressed that while Indonesia is committed to these multinational agreements, such cooperation must consistently align with domestic interests. The government's current diplomatic strategy focuses on leveraging these external partnerships to secure sustainable development, trade expansion, and long-term prosperity. Various sectors, such as environmental management and human resource training, remain key pillars in these comprehensive efforts to integrate Indonesia more effectively into global and regional economic frameworks.",
